    "detailed_description": "In this game you have to restore seasons. Summer, Winter, Spring and Autumn aren't functioning properly, so you have to use your Match3 skills to get it fixed.<br />\r\nBuild a town to recreate rain,snow,clouds and more.<br />\r\nAside from that, there's some bonus games - Mahjongs and Spot The Difference scenes.<br />\r\nYou can play Relaxed, Timed and Moves limited modes. And during the play you can switch the game mode.<br />\r\nOur Mahjongs aren't similar to regular Mahjongs, so we suggest you trying ours.",
